cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "wind-agent-30: An Industrial AI Agent for Wind Turbine O&M"
abstract: >-
  An industrial AI agent that connects a large language model to wind turbine
  equipment via MCP and Modbus/OPC UA, and grounds its fault-diagnosis answers
  in maintenance SOPs through hybrid retrieval with quantitative evaluation.
  Designed under a read-only-by-default safety principle with
  human-in-the-loop authority.
type: software
